# Build-time configuration only.
#
# These two values are compiled into the frontend JavaScript at build time.
# They are constant local-storage key names, not secrets, and the code already
# has safe defaults for both. You do NOT need to set them. Everything else CHOps
# needs (ENCRYPTION_SECRET, the admin credentials, etc.) is supplied at runtime and
# must NOT be put here.

# VITE_QURIOZ_KEY=quriozchatstorage
# VITE_SELECTEDAID_DBS=aiselectedid